  2. Implement run_app() to call it and return a RAGRunResult.

REPORT_CSV: each golden's per-metric scores (name/score/threshold/success/
reason) are appended to this CSV as they run   one row per metric, so you
can filter/sort by metric or golden afterward instead of reading raw
